    description: "Redis and x265 bakeoff assessments identify function-pointer dispatch as a gap. When a struct field of function-pointer type is assigned (e.g., x265_api.encoder_open = x265_encoder_open) and later invoked (api->encoder_open()), create dispatches_to edges. Also relevant for Redis command dispatch (redisCommand.proc). Complex: assignment and invocation often in different translation units."  # 30cb
